            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Tamil for a medal, then the Tamil for a champion."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: பங்கெடு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பங்கெடு — paṅkeṭu — \"to take part\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "நூறு மாணவர்கள் போட்டியில் பங்கெடுத்தார்கள். nūṟu māṇavarkaḷ pōṭṭiyil paṅkeṭuttārkaḷ. A hundred students took part in the competition."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): பங்கெடுத்தேன், paṅkeṭuttēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What you take part in takes -இல்: போட்டியில் பங்கெடு (paṅkeṭu). பங்கு means \"a share\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "பங்கெடு (paṅkeṭu) is a native compound: பங்கு (paṅku), \"a share, a part\", from பகு, \"to divide\" (DEDR 3808), and எடு (eṭu), \"to take\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
