              "text": "ஆடுகளம் — āṭukaḷam — \"a pitch; a court\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மழையால் ஆடுகளம் நனைந்திருந்தது. maḻaiyāl āṭukaḷam naṉaintiruntatu. Because of the rain the pitch was soaked."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Word for word \"playing ground\": ஆடு \"to play\" + களம் (kaḷam) \"a field, a floor\"."
            }
          ]
        },
